{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3589632d2b5bb790616662a4d480cabf6c1c43db97d4529db813abf17f9b26d6", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。仕事の打ち上げも兼ねて、\n桃子と一緒にフラワーパークへと遊びにきた……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。顺便庆祝工作结束，和桃子一起到花卉公园玩了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd6803d834d995a1045e75d3ab699581895b05a17e86857f1086d6a6cad3e48c", "ja": "わぁ、お花がこんなにいっぱい……！\nあれ？　向こうは色が違う……。別の種類のお花かな？", "zh": "哇，有好多花啊……！\n咦？那边的颜色不一样……是别的种类的花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6f2e36ab139f9550db0124d2e9e6d9d94b934f42d261dea239d8683ca5cdaf2e", "ja": "そうみたいだな。それにしても、桃子がそんなに\n喜んでくれるなんて……ここを選んで正解だったよ。", "zh": "看来是这样。不过，桃子能这么高兴……选这里真是选对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd53ea5228702c5f75b0d033790bae75688134d9205a0b52e8747c26ba9748da", "ja": "ま、まあ……お兄ちゃんが選んだにしては、\nなかなかいい場所だと思うよ。桃子がほめてあげる♪", "zh": "嗯、嗯……虽说是哥哥选的，但我觉得这里还算是个不错的地方。桃子就夸夸你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1004_p", "source_sha256": "435dc918aaf41fa4fd2c807668e88a04e2951af0460298b30f5eee5b3d896ae6", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。「場所はお兄ちゃんが考えて」って\n言われた時は、ずいぶん悩んだけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。被要求“地点由哥哥来想”的时候，我可是苦恼了好一阵子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "65436195bb2f79c7ee390f4c047541799aeeaa0012b2c0f93132f26409eaef58", "ja": "ふふっ。たまには、そういうのもいいかなって。\nそれでね、ちょっと聞きたいんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，偶尔这样也不错嘛。\n那个，我想问你一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "afa4c8555575adc5459fdaf8db3d49d7e58253d43df0a56632fc5aab305d7ae8", "ja": "お兄ちゃんは、どうしてここを選んだの？", "zh": "哥哥为什么选择了这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1007_p", "source_sha256": "132f7126bfb9926fc5787b2c16802ab91a153b58d772e7465e2616e76b36d116", "ja": "それは、桃子が行きたいのかなって思ったから。\n前に、雑誌に載ってたこの場所を熱心に見てただろ？", "zh": "因为我觉得，桃子可能想来这里。\n之前你不是一直很认真地看杂志上刊登的这个地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "c0cb5a44e1c8045a5b8bd610f58e8f400fd7c8a9c73aca12d9b15217f8cd7d7c", "ja": "ふうん……。\nお兄ちゃん、そんなとこまで見てたんだ……。", "zh": "哦……这样啊。\n没想到哥哥连这种地方都注意到了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1009_p", "source_sha256": "26fc630551426ef6e9dbace7024b3cf73c7204c644e6858346bbd9211390da1e", "ja": "……うん？　なにか言ったか？", "zh": "……嗯？你刚才说什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "cfb5a0dab97d38d011adeaee53adac2185d9ed38886315f1d25950ea4bf394f8", "ja": "ううん、なんでもない。お兄ちゃんが、\nちゃんとお仕事してるんだなって思っただけ。", "zh": "没、没什么。桃子只是觉得，\n大哥哥原来有在好好工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "7acbb87467fbb7a4b6ce7574b8e28a921058dff7b743a2143719e3641202b4d1", "ja": "桃子、ずっと気になってたんだ。写真であんなに\nきれいなら、行ったらもっとすごいんだろうなって。", "zh": "桃子一直都很在意。照片里都那么漂亮了，要是亲自去的话，一定会更加震撼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "92a058c92b6f7d11d769f82f8af137c51e24ca86fdbf0262d85c5a75785742f9", "ja": "でもお花畑で喜ぶなんて、子どもっぽいでしょ？\nだから……。", "zh": "不过，居然会因为花田而高兴，很孩子气吧？\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2fe4bad0ddc94a2f28a91b0599bbb3f555e3e585f008e2dcf5a665a8745a5c0e", "ja": "そんなことないよ。綺麗なものに夢中になるのに、\n大人も子供も関係ないからな。", "zh": "没那回事。沉浸于美丽的事物，与大人还是孩子都没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "421e8c6f976738beef72fd3e375b372aa72e3709ccea04d84cc8066e874fd6bd", "ja": "……そ、そっか。", "zh": "……这、这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1015_p", "source_sha256": "687e9c4ef67968342046a60019ef7d9ab861eaf0e8ec20e1f424b957dd3278c0", "ja": "ああ。この綺麗な景色を見て、\n桃子が夢中になる気持ちがよくわかったよ。", "zh": "啊。看到这么美丽的景色，我很能理解桃子为什么会着迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6088d254b242b2a18006dec76219cb110f37215dec57fc231433e3036affdb8f", "ja": "広い敷地だから、見る場所はまだまだありそうだな！\n思いきり楽しまないと、日が暮れちゃいそうだ！", "zh": "占地这么大，看来能看的地方还有很多呢！\n要是不抓紧好好玩个够，太阳都要落山啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "f581cda3869dcb6637ecae2762cfee6d02a8c01ae650853da4a2a674ac243056", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "大哥哥……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "a79c22202b7c0b56b9b4b9b4be0a8ab71ca0464a877ae655c78978c9954e55cc", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。でも桃子だけ楽しんでも\nつまらないから、お兄ちゃんも楽しむこと！　いい？", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。不过要是只有桃子一个人开心也没意思，所以哥哥也要开心哦！可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "ce1c23a1ba9cec045ac9426d9924302d077e8deeaf42c5031adb54f974bb2f21", "ja": "それとね……今日のことは、誰にもいわないで。\n子どもっぽくて、恥ずかしいから……。", "zh": "还有……今天的事，谁都不要告诉。因为太孩子气了，我会不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1020_p", "source_sha256": "17015a86cacb896687c8b7a7f80845433ba9b5108c8ea17be4733434df978b9d", "ja": "わかった、誰にも言わないよ。", "zh": "知道了，我不会告诉任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "74ce2e4a30afc7c52fea3f790c87666c3cf31cc16386e0afb1a4636122c22677", "ja": "ありがとう……。それじゃ、お兄ちゃん！　桃子、\nあっちのお花、見に行きたい！　ほらほら、急いで！", "zh": "谢谢你……那，大哥哥！桃子想去看看\n那边的花！快点快点，抓紧啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0344_1022_p", "source_sha256": "61957b0811038342c304479969b560b2b5dbdd6d30cca3f1c088229f47ac1c24", "ja": "（日が暮れるまで桃子とフラワーパークを満喫した。\n疲れて寝てしまう程、桃子は楽しんだみたいだな！）", "zh": "（和桃子在花卉公园尽情玩到了天黑。\n看来桃子玩得太开心，都累得睡着了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
